            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# 1.1

- Add a note to any city or timezone (right-click a row → Add Note…) — handy for tracking
  which client or team is in which city.
- Fix the clock sometimes wrapping onto two lines (e.g. "11:31 A" / "M").
- The app now checks for updates automatically and can check on demand from
  Settings → Check for Updates…
]]></description>
